                                    <p>Drum of Ionic column with inscription panel made by smoothing away fluting on one side. Same agonothete. Victor: Marcus Oureios Markianos wins boys' wrestling twice at the Maximianian games, and is also adjudicated at Potheia in Ancyra.</p>
